@startuml Server Module Structure

title Server Module - Spring Boot Backend

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
    BorderColor #999999
}

package "server" {
    
    [ServerApplication\n@SpringBootApplication] as App #6DB33F
    
    note right of App
        **진입점**
        Spring Boot 메인 클래스
        포트: 8080 (기본값)
    end note
    
    package "controller" #4CAF50 {
        [HelloController\n@RestController] as Controller
        
        note right of Controller
            **REST API**
            - GET /api/hello
            - GET /api/health
        end note
    }
    
    package "config" #FF9800 {
        [SecurityConfig\n@Configuration] as Security
        
        note right of Security
            **Spring Security**
            - CSRF 비활성화
            - 모든 API 허용
            - H2 콘솔 허용
        end note
    }
    
    package "domain\n(예정)" #2196F3 {
        [Entity Classes] as Entity
    }
    
    package "repository\n(예정)" #2196F3 {
        [JPA Repository] as Repository
    }
    
    package "service\n(예정)" {
        [Business Logic] as Service
    }
    
    App --> Controller
    App --> Security
    Controller ..> Service : uses
    Service ..> Repository : uses
    Repository ..> Entity : manages
}

package "External Systems" {
    database "PostgreSQL\n(Production)" as Postgres
    database "H2\n(Test/Dev)" as H2
    database "Redis\n(Cache)" as Redis
    cloud "Prometheus\n(Metrics)" as Prometheus
}

App --> Postgres : JPA
App --> H2 : Test
App --> Redis : Cache
App --> Prometheus : Actuator

package "Dependencies" {
    [Spring Boot Web] as Web
    [Spring Data JPA] as JPA
    [Spring Security] as SpringSecurity
    [Flyway Migration] as Flyway
    [Actuator] as Actuator
    [shared module] as Shared
}

App --> Web
App --> JPA
App --> SpringSecurity
App --> Flyway
App --> Actuator
App --> Shared

note bottom of server
    **빌드 설정**
    - Kotlin JVM Plugin
    - Spring Boot 3.x
    - Java 17
    
    **주요 기능**
    - REST API
    - JWT 인증 (예정)
    - JPA/Hibernate ORM
    - Flyway 마이그레이션
    - Actuator 모니터링
    - Prometheus 메트릭
end note

@enduml
